+| Share per-attempt cfo.ai reports with workspace members? | This separate, default-No choice appears when cfo.ai is enabled. Yes sends repository, run/task IDs, task title and issue URL, size, model, tokens, cost, ceiling, outcome, and decision text to workspace memory, where workspace members can see it. Use `--cfoai-reports yes|no` for non-interactive init. |
